From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 22:40:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/mediatek: Add the MT6789 DSI to the DDP components

mtk_dsi binds "mediatek,mt6789-dsi", but the DDP component table did not
list it, so mediatek-drm never added the DSI to the main path and could
not create the CRTC: "Not creating crtc 0 because component 14 is
disabled or missing". List it as an MTK_DSI component.

Signed-off-by: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/mediatek/mtk_drm_drv.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/mediatek/mtk_drm_drv.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/mediatek/mtk_drm_drv.c
index ddb39ca7..fcfb0d43 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/mediatek/mtk_drm_drv.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/mediatek/mtk_drm_drv.c
@@ -841,6 +841,8 @@ static const struct of_device_id mtk_ddp_comp_dt_ids[] = {
 	  .data = (void *)MTK_DPI },
 	{ .compatible = "mediatek,mt2701-dsi",
 	  .data = (void *)MTK_DSI },
+	{ .compatible = "mediatek,mt6789-dsi",
+	  .data = (void *)MTK_DSI },
 	{ .compatible = "mediatek,mt8173-dsi",
 	  .data = (void *)MTK_DSI },
 	{ .compatible = "mediatek,mt8183-dsi",
